Package: SCION
Title: Spatiotemporal Clustering and Inference of Omics Networks
Version: 5.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Natalie", "Clark", , "nclark@broadinstitute.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Infers gene regulatory / omics networks from multi-omics data using
    random-forest based feature importance (a GENIE3-style approach), with optional
    pre-clustering of genes, permutation-based FDR thresholding of inferred edges,
    network visualization, and a Shiny app covering the full run / threshold /
    visualize workflow.
